• Comprehensive Test Coverage
• Multi-Database Testing
• Security Validation
• Performance Testing
• Continuous Integration
end note

note left of build_deploy
**Deployment Flexibility**
• JAR (Self-contained)
• WAR (Traditional Servlet)
• Docker Containers
• Kubernetes Orchestration
• Cloud-Native Ready
end note

@enduml